2️⃣ Participant Pool v1 (Design Explanation)

Why it exists
	•	Prevents early concentration from dominating rewards
	•	Makes small holders feel rewarded immediately
	•	Encourages participation beyond hoarding early IDs

Why it’s safe
	•	Uses square-root weighting → diminishing returns
	•	Separate pool → does not dilute inscription rarity
	•	Can be removed or expanded later without breaking owner logic

Why v1 is enough
	•	No points systems
	•	No time decay
	•	No interaction spam incentives
	•	Just: “holding something earns you something”

